export/reel-01-v18.mp4

# Renders. Every one is regenerable from tracked inputs with export/render.sh, and the
# list above tried to name them one at a time — which is why export/reel-01.mp4 slipped
# through and the working tree was never clean. One pattern instead of a growing list.
#
# The cost of the old approach: three renders are already in history at 26MB, in a 95MB
# repository. At one episode a week that is the whole repo inside a year, for files a
# script rebuilds in twenty minutes.
export/*.mp4
